79. g4 Be7 {(Bulletin now gives 80.Nf4 Bh4 81.Ne6 Be1 82.Nf4 Bh4 83.Ng2 Bd8 84.
h4 Be7 85.g5+ Kh5 86.Nf4+ 1-0, which doesn't make much sense as it is not
possible to gain/lose a move with the knight. So let's imagine the following
sequence happens in order for the score to make sense after 82.Ng2...)} 80. Ne6
Bh4 81. Nf4 Bg5 82. Ng2 Bd8 83. h4 Be7 84. g5+ Kh5 85. Nf4+ 1-0

